 exhilarating adventure, you'll take on the role of a nimble monke, navigating a complex network of branches, obstacles, and challenges in a race against time.\n\nFeatures:\n\nBranching Gameplay: Prepare to swing, leap, and dash through an intricate labyrinth of branches. Your path is not just linear; it's a dynamic and ever-changing network that demands quick thinking and precise execution.\n\nStrategic Decision-Making: Choose your path wisely. Each decision you make could lead to success or result in a tangled fall. Anticipate obstacles, assess risks, and calculate the best route as you aim to bring your monke to the finish line.\n\nSpeed and Agility: Showcase your monke's extraordinary agility as you traverse the branches with fluid movements. Master the art of swinging, jumping, and wall-running to maintain your momentum and secure your victory.\n\nObstacles and Challenges: Face a variety of challenges that will test your skills to the limit. From swinging pendulums and moving platforms to thorny barriers, every level presents new hurdles to overcome.\n\nMultiplayer Race: Join a thrilling multiplayer experience where you can challenge friends or compete against players worldwide. Engage in head-to-head races, where the quickest and most strategic monke emerges as the victor.\n\n", "short_description": "Fun monkey game to play in"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/javan-langursvr/startsida", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Death", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/javanlangursvr/startsida", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphi